	# ── Runestone lore ──
	"UI_RUNESTONE": "Runestone", "PROMPT_READ_RUNESTONE": "[E] Read runestone",
	"LORE_1": "\"Odin sent us here. The tenth world, land of the unjudged.\"",
	"LORE_2": "\"The antlered one rules the forest. When you hear the hooves, raise your bow.\"",
	"LORE_3": "\"We mined iron from the marsh. Half of us never came back for it.\"",
	"LORE_4": "\"Nothing grows on the mountain. Only cold, and what endures cold.\"",
	"LORE_5": "\"Grass on the plains stands taller than a man, and things with three eyes hide in it.\"",
	"LORE_6": "\"In the mist, do not trust sound. The mist imitates it.\"",
	"LORE_7": "\"In the land of fire even stone burns. All we left behind was ash.\"",
	"LORE_8": "\"Offer at the five altars and the gate opens - whether that is a blessing, I cannot say.\"",
	"LORE_9": "\"I have died thirty-seven times and returned thirty-seven times. That is the punishment.\"",
	"LORE_10": "\"Valhalla lies beyond this. Dying here will not take you there.\"",
